<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Form 01</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:10mm 12mm 16mm;@bottom-center{content:"Bloomwell Home Care Uganda Limited · Nest Mama Program · Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);font:7pt Arial,sans-serif;color:#47615E}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#0B2E2A;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:1.35}
.hd{background:#08675F;color:#fff;padding:3mm 5mm;border-bottom:1.4mm solid #F8991E}.hd table{width:100%}.hd td{vertical-align:middle}.hd .n{font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold}.hd .s{font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}.hd .r{text-align:right;font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}
.tt{border:.3mm solid #08675F;background:#DDF0EC;padding:2.5mm 3mm;margin:3mm 0}.tt b{font-size:12pt;color:#08675F}.tt div{font-size:7.5pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:1mm}
h3{font-size:9pt;color:#08675F;margin:4mm 0 1.5mm;border-bottom:.3mm solid #F8991E;padding-bottom:.8mm;break-after:avoid}
table.r{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2mm 0;margin:0 -2mm}table.r{table-layout:fixed}
.c{vertical-align:bottom;padding-top:1.5mm}.l{display:block;font-size:6.8pt;color:#47615E}.v{display:block;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:5.5mm;font-size:8.5pt;font-weight:bold}
.w{margin-top:1.5mm;break-inside:avoid}.w .v{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:11mm;padding:1mm 1.5mm;font-weight:normal;background:#FBFDFC}
.cb{margin-top:1.8mm;break-inside:avoid}.cb .o{display:inline-block;margin:0 4mm 0 0;font-size:8.5pt}.cb .l{display:inline;margin-right:3mm;font-size:8pt;color:#0B2E2A;font-weight:bold}
.n{border:.3mm solid #E0B25A;background:#FFF6E3;padding:2mm 3mm;margin-top:2.5mm;font-size:7.8pt;break-inside:avoid}
p.t{margin:2mm 0;font-size:8.3pt;break-inside:avoid}
table.g{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:2mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.g th{background:#08675F;color:#fff;font-size:6.8pt;padding:1.4mm;text-align:left}.g td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;height:7.5mm;padding:.5mm 1.5mm;font-size:8pt}.g tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#F2F8F6}
table.s{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:3mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.s th{background:#E8F2F0;font-size:6.8pt;text-align:left;padding:1.2mm;border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5}.s td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;padding:1.2mm;vertical-align:top;height:15mm;font-size:7.8pt}
.s .m{font-size:6.8pt;line-height:1.5}.si{max-height:10mm;display:block}.ev{font-size:6pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:.8mm}
.idr{margin-top:1mm}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid}</style></head><body><div class="hd"><table><tr><td style="width:14mm">{{ org.mark_svg|safe }}</td><td><div class="n">BLOOMWELL HOME CARE UGANDA LIMITED</div><div class="s">Patient consent and care forms · Nest Mama Program · You rest, we care</div></td><td class="r">{{ org.city }}, Uganda<br>{{ org.phone }}</td></tr></table></div><div class="tt"><b>FORM 01. REGISTRATION AND CONTACT ARRANGEMENTS</b><div>Identify the patient and record contact, referral and initial safety information. Completed by BLOOMWELL staff at intake.</div></div><table class="r idr"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient full name</span><span class="v">{{ patient.name }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">DOB / age</span><span class="v">{{ patient.dob }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient record ID</span><span class="v">{{ patient.record_id }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Date / time</span><span class="v">{{ form.datetime }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Patient details and contact arrangements</h3><div class="w"><span class="l">Home / service address and directions</span><span class="v">{{ v.home_service_address_and_directions or prefill.home_service_address_and_directions }}</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient telephone</span><span class="v">{{ v.patient_telephone or prefill.patient_telephone }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Preferred language</span><span class="v">{{ v.preferred_language or prefill.preferred_language }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Communication / accessibility support required</span><span class="v">{{ v.communication_accessibility_support_requ or prefill.communication_accessibility_support_requ }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Referring clinician / facility and contact</span><span class="v">{{ v.referring_clinician_facility_and_contact or prefill.referring_clinician_facility_and_contact }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Reason for referral and documents received</span><span class="v">{{ v.reason_for_referral_and_documents_receiv or prefill.reason_for_referral_and_documents_receiv }}</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Primary caregiver</span><span class="v">{{ v.primary_caregiver or prefill.primary_caregiver }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Caregiver relationship</span><span class="v">{{ v.caregiver_relationship or prefill.caregiver_relationship }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Caregiver telephone</span><span class="v">{{ v.caregiver_telephone or prefill.caregiver_telephone }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Available care hours</span><span class="v">{{ v.available_care_hours or prefill.available_care_hours }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Emergency contact</span><span class="v">{{ v.emergency_contact or prefill.emergency_contact }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Emergency contact relationship</span><span class="v">{{ v.emergency_contact_relationship or prefill.emergency_contact_relationship }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Emergency contact telephone</span><span class="v">{{ v.emergency_contact_telephone or prefill.emergency_contact_telephone }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Alternative contact</span><span class="v">{{ v.alternative_contact or prefill.alternative_contact }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Payer / client name and Service Agreement reference</span><span class="v">{{ v.payer_client_name_and_service_agreement_ or prefill.payer_client_name_and_service_agreement_ }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="n">Being a payer, relative or emergency contact does not by itself authorise treatment decisions or access to clinical information. Record lawful authority on Form 03.</div><h3>Initial safety information</h3><div class="cb"><span class="l">Allergies / reactions:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.allergies_reactions == "Known" else "☐" }} Known</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.allergies_reactions == "None known" else "☐" }} None known</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.allergies_reactions == "Not yet established" else "☐" }} Not yet established</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Substance, reaction and severity</span><span class="v">{{ v.substance_reaction_and_severity or prefill.substance_reaction_and_severity }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Urgent concerns or immediate referral action</span><span class="v">{{ v.urgent_concerns_or_immediate_referral_ac or prefill.urgent_concerns_or_immediate_referral_ac }}</span></div><div class="cb"><span class="l">Identity checked using two identifiers:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.identity_checked_using_two_identifiers == "Yes" else "☐" }} Yes</span></div><h3>Signatures</h3><table class="s"><tr><th style="width:27mm">Role</th><th style="width:44mm">Name and details</th><th style="width:30mm">Method</th><th>Signature or thumbprint, with e-signature evidence</th><th style="width:24mm">Date / time</th></tr><tr><td><b>BLOOMWELL staff</b></td><td>{{ sig.staff.name or author.name }}<div class="m">Name and role</div><div>{{ sig.staff.detail or author.registration_line }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.staff.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.staff.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.staff.method == "password" else "☐" }} Account password<br></td><td>{% if sig.staff.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.staff.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.staff.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.staff.at }}</td></tr></table></body></html>